  "title": "RUIPRO Keystone Wall Plate with MPO Coupler",
  "handle": "keystone-wall-plate-with-mpo-coupler",
  "description": "<p><b><span><strong>Model: MPO Keystone</strong></span></b></p>\n<p>Support MPO-MPO connection</p>\n<p>Standard interface, easily installed on the wall panel</p>\n<p><span>Black MPO keystone couplers come pre-installed and can be removed.</span></p>\n<article data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{\"copyFrom\":\"im-native\"},[\"p\",{},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\",\"color\":\"#171A1D\"},\"This dedicated keystone solution with integrated coupler and wallplate is custom-fit for RUIPRO Detachable PURE Fiber Optic HDMI cable. Featuring a high-precision molded structure, it ensures a tight, reliable fit for hassle-free installation and flawless signal transmission\"]]],[\"p\",{},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\",\"color\":\"#171A1D\"},\"Flame-Retardant &amp; Eco-Friendly\"]]],[\"p\",{},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\",\"color\":\"#171A1D\"},\"Made from durable PC material, this Keystone Wallplate is flame-retardant, safe, and eco-friendly, offering long-lasting performance and reliability\"]]]]' class=\"4ever-article\">\n<p class=\"p\"><b><span class=\"15\">Precision </span></b><b><span class=\"15\">Keystone</span></b><b><span class=\"15\"> for Stable Connection:\u00a0</span></b><span>This\u00a0precision-molded keystone</span><span>\u00a0is custom-fit for the RUIPRO </span><span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">d</span></span><span>etachable\u00a0</span><span>full fiber optic cable systems</span><span></span><span>. The high-precision molded structure ensures a tight, stable fit, providing </span><span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">easy</span></span><span>\u00a0installation and reliable signal transmission for long</span><span>\u00a0</span><span>lasting performance. And </span><span>the keystone modules can be easily removed from the plates.</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\"><b><span class=\"15\">Reliable </span></b><b><span class=\"15\">HDMI Extension </span></b><b><span class=\"15\">Solution: </span></b><span>Easily extend your HDMI connection over long distances with this keystone, </span><span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">perfect</span></span><span>\u00a0for wall or ceiling installations. It delivers stable, high</span><span>\u00a0</span><span>quality signal transmission without degradation, ideal for home theaters, conference rooms, and commercial AV systems</span><span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\"><b><span class=\"15\">Effortless Installation: </span></b><span>The snap-in design ensures a secure and reliable connection</span><span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">. </span></span><span>Simply connect the</span><span>\u00a0</span><span>MPO </span><span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">m</span></span><span>ale </span><span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">connector</span></span><span>\u00a0to the front</span><span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">,</span></span><span>\u00a0the MPO </span><span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">f</span></span><span>emale </span><span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">c</span></span><span>onnector to the rear of the </span><span>keystone</span><span>\u00a0for a quick and hassle-free setup</span><span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\"><b><span class=\"15\">Flame-Retardant, Eco-Friendly</span></b><b><span class=\"15\">\u00a0<span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">and Neat </span></span></b><b><span class=\"15\">Design: </span></b><span>Made from high-quality, eco-friendly PC material, this </span><span>keystone</span><span>\u00a0is flame-retardant for enhanced safety. The neat design conceals cables and connectors within the wall, reducing clutter and providing a clean, professional appearance in homes, offices, or commercial spaces</span><span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\"><b><span class=\"15\">Upgr</span></b><b><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">a</span></span></b><b><span class=\"15\">deable and Versatile: </span></b><span>The </span><span>keystone wall</span><span>\u00a0</span><span>plate</span><span>\u00a0allows easy upgrades and replacements of </span><span>couplers </span><span>without the need to replace the entire unit. Available in 1 to 4 ports, it offers customizable solutions for HDMI, Ethernet, audio, and more, providing a flexible, all-in-one solution</span><span></span></p>\n</article>",
